        "diff": "--- /dev/null\n+++ /home/agent/workspace/README.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# greet-pkg\n+\n+A minimal Node.js package that exports a simple greeting function.\n+\n+## Install\n+\n+```bash\n+npm install greet-pkg\n+```\n+\n+## Usage\n+\n+```js\n+const { greet } = require(\"./index\");\n+\n+greet();        // \"Hello, world!\"\n+greet(\"Ada\");   // \"Hello, Ada!\"\n+```\n+\n+## API\n+\n+### `greet(name?)`\n+\n+Returns the string `Hello, <name>!`. Defaults to `\"world\"` when `name` is omitted.\n+\n+## License\n+\n+MIT\n"
